    <div class="section" id="s4">
      <p class="sec-num">04 —</p>
      <h2>The TCP/IP Model — The Internet's Blueprint</h2>
      <p>While the OSI model is a theoretical framework for understanding networks, the <strong>TCP/IP model</strong>
        (also called the Internet Model or DoD Model) is the practical model the internet actually runs on. It
        compresses OSI's 7 layers into <strong>4 layers</strong>.</p>

