      <h4>ICMP — Internet Control Message Protocol</h4>
      <p>The diagnostic tool of the network layer. ICMP sends control messages: "Host unreachable," "Time exceeded,"
        "Destination network unknown." The famous <code>ping</code> and <code>traceroute</code> commands use ICMP.</p>

      <h4>Routing Protocols</h4>
